* NMOS Transistor
M1 2 5 4 4 NMOS

* Resistors
RD 3 2 RD_VALUE
RS 2 1 RS_VALUE
RG 5 8 RG_VALUE

* Voltage Sources
VDD 3 0 DC 5V
VSS 1 0 DC -5V

* Capacitors
C1 5 2 C1_VALUE
C2 2 6 C2_VALUE

* Nodes
* 0 - Ground
* 1 - Source RS connection
* 2 - Node between RS, RD, M1, Capacitors
* 3 - +5V
* 4 - Source terminal connection for body
* 5 - Gate connected to RG, C1, Input X
* 6 - Output node connected to C2, Output Z
* 8 - Ground connection for RG